### Get all leaderboards
GET http://localhost:3000/api/leaderboards

### Get specific leaderboard by ID (replace LEADERBOARD_ID with actual leaderboard ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/leaderboards/170000004

### Get leaderboard with limit
GET http://localhost:3000/api/leaderboards/170000004?limit=50

### Get leaderboard with pagination
# Note: Use 'after' or 'before' values from the 'paging' property in API responses
# Example: GET http://localhost:3000/api/leaderboards/170000004?limit=20&after=CURSOR_FROM_PREVIOUS_RESPONSE
GET http://localhost:3000/api/leaderboards/170000004?limit=20
